"""
Camera Bridge - Smart Parking OCR and MQTT gate control.

Runtime flow:
RFID UID from MQTT -> burst capture ESP32-CAM -> OpenCV preprocess ->
EasyOCR plate extraction -> MongoDB validation -> MQTT OPEN command.
"""

